{"name":"Fricassée","hex":"#ffe6c2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fricassée","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative spelling of fricassee."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Alternative spelling of fricassee."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fricass%C3%A9e"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fricassee","blocks":[{"text":"Fricassee or fricassée is a stew made with pieces of meat that have been browned in butter, then served in a sauce flavored with the cooking stock. Fricassee is usually made with chicken, veal or rabbit, with variations limited only by the ingredients the cook has at hand."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/18-10-20_MG_4656.jpg/330px-18-10-20_MG_4656.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fricassee","wikidata":"Q791790"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Blue-Beige Gradient","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blue-Beige_Gradient.jpg/500px-Blue-Beige_Gradient.jpg","ratio":1.6,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blue-Beige_Gradient.jpg","share":0.371875},{"title":"Kia Morning JA PE2 Milky Beige (19)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Kia_Morning_JA_PE2_Milky_Beige_%2819%29.jpg/500px-Kia_Morning_JA_PE2_Milky_Beige_%2819%29.jpg","ratio":1.3334512022630836,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kia_Morning_JA_PE2_Milky_Beige_(19).jpg","share":0.14625},{"title":"Chicken Fricassée with Red Cabbage","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Chicken_Fricass%C3%A9e_with_Red_Cabbage.jpg/500px-Chicken_Fricass%C3%A9e_with_Red_Cabbage.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chicken_Fricass%C3%A9e_with_Red_Cabbage.jpg","share":0.12},{"title":"Frikassee","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Frikassee.jpg/500px-Frikassee.jpg","ratio":1.50019